{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A turn-based, strategic puzzle game about creating and expanding companies and trading stocks! It combines strategic depth elements of chess with a fun and challenging stock trading experience. Wisely place tiles on the board to force lucrative mergers. You may want to invest in the involved companies first though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745610570\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve various puzzles and missions on pre-defined maps vs other competitors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn in-game rewards (Achievements, Leaderboards, Levels, Ranks)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your gameplay experience with different card backs and other cosmetics, unlockable through gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745610570\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Alpha Sheik","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2746610/7ebd456ca0851f73bd25c73748a335249838bb5e.jpg"},{"name":"And so it begins\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2746610/c54390d736f5ae9c386800d6c9a48e6db3784cfd.jpg"},{"name":"To the victor go the spoils.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2746610/59cce9ed41f72444c3eb120372a6dfeb748f8473.jpg"},{"name":"Reporting for duty!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2746610/50205ef74db0ca4329cb07928a9f1aa223acacd6.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced competitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2746610/64ede30a85a5ea116d433e344af84914c67a3858.jpg"},{"name":"Exp